OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA clear
OL,6,Fnight for much of the region, some
OL,7,Fcloud affecting Derbyshire later, but
OL,8,Fremaining dry. Given light winds,
OL,9,Ftemperatures will fall rather quickly,
OL,10,Fwith a rather chilly end to the night,
OL,11,Fespecially in rural areas.
OL,12,
OL,13,CThursday:FFine, dry and largely sunny
OL,14,Fafter a fairly cool start. The
OL,15,Fsunshine perhaps turning slightly hazy
OL,16,Fat times, but a fairly warm day
OL,17,Foverall with mainly light winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
