OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FDry,
OL,6,Fgenerally bright on Friday, although
OL,7,Fprobably cloudier later. Often dry and
OL,8,Fbright over the weekend, although a
OL,9,Fchance of rain on Sunday. Mainly light
OL,10,Fwinds, temperatures slightly above
OL,11,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
